Like a laptop, or a cell phone, or a personal stereo.

02:51:40.280 --> 02:51:41.380
It's still not enough.

02:51:41.780 --> 02:51:43.020
They could all be the detonator.

02:51:43.220 --> 02:51:44.480
I'll have to check them out.

02:51:45.660 --> 02:51:46.200
Hold it!

02:51:46.360 --> 02:51:47.560
You must be crazy!

02:51:49.040 --> 02:51:51.260
Think I'm gonna let you leave after all this?

02:51:51.440 --> 02:51:53.160
I really have to go to the bathroom.

02:51:53.180 --> 02:51:54.880
You went there less than an hour ago.

02:51:55.060 --> 02:51:55.880
I'm super thirsty.

02:51:56.140 --> 02:51:57.240
Deal with it for a while.

02:51:57.780 --> 02:51:58.220
Souvenirs!

02:51:58.360 --> 02:51:59.800
You can buy them on the way back.

02:52:00.380 --> 02:52:09.670
legs are cramped. Tough luck. What is it about trips that make kids go nuts? Only seven minutes!

02:52:09.980 --> 02:52:14.320
No time to inspect all three devices. The only hope now is to get everyone off the train,

02:52:14.540 --> 02:52:22.910
fast. But no one listens to me. I'm down to my last resort. I have to let Rachel know who I really

02:52:22.910 --> 02:52:28.110
am. Once she knows, she'll believe, and the conductor will actually take her seriously.

02:52:30.380 --> 02:52:36.500
But if I fail, I have to try.

02:52:39.720 --> 02:52:41.120
Rachel, I need to tell you.

02:52:41.300 --> 02:52:42.060
You know what I think?

02:52:42.180 --> 02:52:44.300
I think you need to start calling me Miss Moore.

02:52:44.440 --> 02:52:47.380
Maybe that way you'll want to treat me with the slightest bit of respect.

02:52:48.360 --> 02:52:49.780
Please listen to me, Rachel.

02:52:50.120 --> 02:52:51.640
See? There you go again.

02:52:51.840 --> 02:52:53.180
Cut it out. I'm being serious.

02:52:53.760 --> 02:52:59.120
I'm sorry, but I've been deceiving you.

02:52:59.300 --> 02:52:59.840
Say what?

02:53:00.670 --> 02:53:04.550
That's just it. I'm not Conan Edegawa, and I'm not in grade school either.

02:53:04.790 --> 02:53:07.170
Believe it or not, my true name is...

02:53:07.540 --> 02:53:11.060
What? We've already gone by the ocean, but that's my favorite!

02:53:11.360 --> 02:53:12.880
Well, you shouldn't have gone to the bathroom.

02:53:12.980 --> 02:53:14.540
It wouldn't have mattered anyway, George.

02:53:14.740 --> 02:53:17.600
This is the mountainside of the train. We can't see the water.

02:53:17.740 --> 02:53:18.700
The mountainside.

02:53:19.740 --> 02:53:20.920
Your view is great!

02:53:21.260 --> 02:53:25.220
Yes, and the weather is helping, too. Mount Fincher was crystal clear.

02:53:25.870 --> 02:53:29.970
But the window next to her seat was facing the sea, and the drapes were down on the...

02:53:30.000 --> 02:53:36.920
other side she couldn't have seen the mountain from there and where was she the diner car yes

02:53:38.920 --> 02:53:43.710
the window by the goons table was facing the mountain she must have seen mount fincher from

02:53:43.710 --> 02:53:51.140
there not from her seat but i haven't been to the diner car all day there was no reason for her to

02:53:51.140 --> 02:53:59.040
lie about that except to cover up her criminal transaction she's the client she has the briefcase

02:53:59.040 --> 02:53:59.480
Spawn.

02:54:01.140 --> 02:54:03.850
Yikes, only one minute left.

02:54:04.660 --> 02:54:10.360
Attention all passengers, please remember that all cell phone calls should be made in the designated areas in the center train car.

02:54:10.850 --> 02:54:13.350
Calls placed in the passenger areas may disturb others.

02:54:13.770 --> 02:54:16.530
Thank you for respecting your fellow travelers and have a nice ride.

02:54:16.850 --> 02:54:18.390
Your phone is the detonator.

02:54:20.050 --> 02:54:21.990
You don't listen very well.

02:54:22.310 --> 02:54:26.430
Hey guys, Miss Moore is taking lunch orders. Whatever you want if you tell her now.

02:54:26.890 --> 02:54:28.990
Ah, ha, how I steam deal!

02:54:28.990 --> 02:54:29.130
No!

02:54:29.470 --> 02:54:29.970
Caviar, aren't you?

02:54:30.640 --> 02:54:33.350
F.R. go with pickle relish. That's snails, right?

02:54:33.550 --> 02:54:35.910
This is a train ride, kids, not a cruise.

02:54:36.330 --> 02:54:39.370
I should have seen it earlier. A laptop, a personal stereo.

02:54:39.730 --> 02:54:43.750
There's no way to make an unsuspecting person press a series of buttons right when you want them to.

02:54:44.010 --> 02:54:47.600
But with a cell phone, it's as easy as dialing a number.

02:54:48.000 --> 02:54:57.080
Two- Hey, it's me.

02:54:58.820 --> 02:54:59.980
And then ten seconds later.

02:55:00.000 --> 02:55:02.700
Later, the train will be blown to multiple bits.

02:55:03.420 --> 02:55:17.480
I hate trains.

02:55:22.960 --> 02:55:23.160
Hello.

02:55:23.380 --> 02:55:24.880
What kind of kid are you?

02:55:25.300 --> 02:55:26.820
The detective kind.

02:55:27.400 --> 02:55:28.260
Corinne's the name.

02:55:28.920 --> 02:55:29.980
Wha- you're a-

02:55:30.000 --> 02:55:30.540
A detective?

02:55:31.700 --> 02:55:34.700
Please, Conan, tell me you had nothing to do with that blast!

02:55:35.280 --> 02:55:37.440
No, I'm just a grade school student!

02:55:40.680 --> 02:55:43.260
After that, the express train screeched to a halt,

02:55:43.320 --> 02:55:46.880
and Inspector McGuire's boys came up from the city to start the investigation.

02:55:47.650 --> 02:55:50.210
We missed the wedding, but we got our souvenirs.

02:55:52.020 --> 02:55:54.540
The businesswoman was arrested for her part in the deal.

02:55:55.320 --> 02:55:58.450
She had bought the briefcase, but they hadn't told her how to open it.

02:55:58.790 --> 02:55:59.970
They gave her the augmented...

02:56:00.000 --> 02:56:05.130
cell phone and made her call them at exactly 10 after 3. In truth, they planned to use the info

02:56:05.130 --> 02:56:13.060
themselves with the 4 million as their capital. After a little legwork, the goons were picked up

02:56:13.060 --> 02:56:19.820
at the penthouse suite of a ritzy hotel, and the case was closed. But my mystery remains unsolved.

02:56:20.320 --> 02:56:25.820
The real men in black coats, the ones I mistook the goons for, they're still at large. And until

02:56:25.820 --> 02:56:29.980
I find them, I'll have to keep my beat as a kid detective. Solving...

02:56:30.000 --> 02:56:33.100
other people's puzzles as I unwrap my own.

02:57:00.190 --> 02:57:10.390
to change and squabble, let's walk.

02:57:30.600 --> 02:57:31.100
With...

02:58:09.790 --> 02:58:12.930
So what were you trying to tell me back there, Conan, about deceiving me?

02:58:13.130 --> 02:58:14.230
I never said that.

02:58:14.450 --> 02:58:17.740
Oh, yes, you did. I've never seen you looking more serious.

02:58:18.610 --> 02:58:22.710
That's just it. I'm not Conan Edegawa, and I'm not in grade school either.

02:58:23.100 --> 02:58:25.560
Believe it or not, true name is...

02:58:26.410 --> 02:58:28.110
Finish it. What's your true name?

02:58:28.270 --> 02:58:29.980
Oh, well, uh, see what...

02:58:30.000 --> 02:58:32.200
What I meant is I'm also called a...

02:58:32.200 --> 02:58:34.140
Mr. Genius Troublemaker!

02:58:58.310 --> 02:58:59.970
Rachel, got any plans for tonight?

02:59:00.000 --> 02:59:04.820
Do you think I'd slave over a hot stove unless I had an extra special person in mind?

02:59:05.060 --> 02:59:06.300
Oh, go on a what?

02:59:06.730 --> 02:59:08.350
Okay, Dad, I'm leaving now.

02:59:08.860 --> 02:59:12.040
All right, but if you catch yourself a guy, make sure he's a rich one.

02:59:12.260 --> 02:59:14.640
A murderer always tends to dampen a party.

02:59:14.840 --> 02:59:16.420
The murderer is...

02:59:16.990 --> 02:59:17.770
You, madam!

02:59:18.900 --> 02:59:21.540
The true criminal is none other than...

02:59:21.730 --> 02:59:24.070
One truth prevails on the next case closed.

02:59:24.330 --> 02:59:25.230
Tragic Valentine.

02:59:30.670 --> 02:59:31.030
Chocolate.

02:59:35.000 --> 02:59:36.180
Well, that's it for the show.

02:59:36.440 --> 02:59:38.340
You can't review it until you watch it.

02:59:38.400 --> 02:59:40.260
Until next time, join us on the Twitch channel.

02:59:41.280 --> 02:59:42.840
Fela's Toonami Reborn out.
